# the text form of a Mach-O model
#
# a thin file prints in model order: the header, the load commands with the
# sections and relocations of each segment, the symbol table, the indirect
# symbol table and the link-edit blobs in file order. every record and field
# takes the name llvm-readobj gives it, so the output lines up field by field
# with what llvm-readobj prints for the same file. a value with a name prints
# its name and its number, the name taken from the constant tables. a flags
# field prints the names of its bits.
#
# the dump prints what the model holds and decodes nothing the reader did not.
# a link-edit blob the model holds as decoded entries prints those entries, and
# one it holds as raw bytes prints the bytes under the name Raw.

